{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/fd325decd820bcdebdb9ff41d8b41d67.poster.avif?t=1769181152\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/fd325decd820bcdebdb9ff41d8b41d67.webm?t=1769181152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WOFG! blends motion capture animations with real time physics. According to top goblin scientists, the simulation is 100% accurate when compared to real-world goblin physics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/64b87e3fb60af80db8a5f7dc40cba770.poster.avif?t=1769181152\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/64b87e3fb60af80db8a5f7dc40cba770.webm?t=1769181152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a ragdoll controller like no other! Take precise control of your goblin on land and while airborne! Aim your feet at the ground for a clean landing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/299c348ae094f809c8828c1886decf19.poster.avif?t=1769181152\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/299c348ae094f809c8828c1886decf19.webm?t=1769181152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>There is no feeling more heartwarming than throwing your friends down a mountain, and knowing they would do the same for you. Grab your best bud and experience WOFG! In splitscreen. Double the Goblins? Half the problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/2caec698bb8140dbee34ed861d95e73d.poster.avif?t=1769181152\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/2caec698bb8140dbee34ed861d95e73d.webm?t=1769181152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>What the heck is up with all this sludge? Seems like a cataclysmic and plot-defining mystery.\u00a0<br>Do you have what it takes to uncover the truth and save Gobland? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/01687b73895213b65db886d8d807e6fc.poster.avif?t=1769181152\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/extras/01687b73895213b65db886d8d807e6fc.webm?t=1769181152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2887920?t=1769181152","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769181152","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2887920/4569805ce315e6b81510d1210383ac97c15f05e0/capsule_231x8